<section class="legal-body">
  <div class="container">
    <p>The Courts, LLC (&ldquo;The Courts,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit our website, contact us, register for programming, purchase products, or otherwise interact with The Courts.</p>

    <div class="legal-toc">
      <h2>On This Page</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#information-we-collect">Information We Collect</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-we-use-information">How We Use Information</a></li>
